    <description>
# PyShell - A Feature-Rich POSIX Shell in Python

A feature-rich, POSIX-compatible shell implemented in Python with advanced scripting capabilities.

## Features
- POSIX Compatibility
- Advanced Arrays (Indexed and Associative)
- Pipeline Support
- Function Definitions
- Parameter Expansion
- Command Substitution
- Arithmetic Expansion
- 50+ Built-in Commands
- Cross-Platform Support

## Usage
After installation, simply run `pyshell` from any command prompt.
